[
  {
    "id": "01-hook",
    "shots": [
      {
        "source": "capture/stage1-1791072082728/raw.mp4",
        "in": 115,
        "duration_actual": 8.186
      }
    ],
    "start": 0,
    "end": 8.186,
    "duration": 8.186,
    "text": "一台小吉普，十九个人要救，前面还堵着四辆坦克。赤色要塞，开打！",
    "audio": "audio\\shared-zh\\01-hook.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "02-rescue",
    "shots": [
      {
        "source": "capture/stage1-1791072082728/raw.mp4",
        "in": 2.3,
        "duration_actual": 8.57
      }
    ],
    "start": 8.186,
    "end": 16.756,
    "duration": 8.57,
    "text": "先用手雷炸开营房，再靠过去接人上车。车后座越来越挤，这趟救援可不能白跑。",
    "audio": "audio\\shared-zh\\02-rescue.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "03-upgrade",
    "shots": [
      {
        "source": "capture/stage1-1791072082728/raw.mp4",
        "in": 8.8,
        "duration_actual": 8.642
      }
    ],
    "start": 16.756,
    "end": 25.398,
    "duration": 8.642,
    "text": "闪光俘虏就是关键补给。接上车，手雷直接升级成火箭，火力终于跟上了。",
    "audio": "audio\\shared-zh\\03-upgrade.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "04-camp",
    "shots": [
      {
        "source": "capture/stage1-1791072082728/raw.mp4",
        "in": 17.8,
        "duration": 4,
        "duration_actual": 4
      },
      {
        "source": "capture/stage1-1791072082728/raw.mp4",
        "in": 28.1,
        "duration_actual": 4.57
      }
    ],
    "start": 25.398,
    "end": 33.968,
    "duration": 8.57,
    "text": "营地大门也能炸开。冲进去继续救人，武器还能升到双向，再到四向火箭。",
    "audio": "audio\\shared-zh\\04-camp.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "05-bridge",
    "shots": [
      {
        "source": "capture/stage1-1791072082728/raw.mp4",
        "in": 39.0,
        "duration_actual": 9.866
      }
    ],
    "start": 33.968,
    "end": 43.834,
    "duration": 9.866,
    "text": "过桥先处理守桥坦克，接走闪光俘虏。看左上角，四向火箭到手，救人和变强是一条线。",
    "audio": "audio\\shared-zh\\05-bridge.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "06-heli",
    "shots": [
      {
        "source": "capture/stage1-1791072082728/raw.mp4",
        "in": 100.0,
        "duration_actual": 9.554
      }
    ],
    "start": 43.834,
    "end": 53.388000000000005,
    "duration": 9.554,
    "text": "找到直升机坪，停稳交接。车上的人数往下减，已送达往上加，十九个人，一个不少。",
    "audio": "audio\\shared-zh\\06-heli.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "07-boss",
    "shots": [
      {
        "source": "capture/stage1-1791072082728/raw.mp4",
        "in": 114.0,
        "duration_actual": 11.786
      }
    ],
    "start": 53.388000000000005,
    "end": 65.174,
    "duration": 11.786,
    "text": "最后是四辆蓝色坦克。先对准再开火，贴太近就往侧面拉。挨炮后护甲确实会掉，无限命可不是无敌。",
    "audio": "audio\\shared-zh\\07-boss.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "08-result",
    "min_duration": 10,
    "shots": [
      {
        "source": "capture/stage1-1791072082728/raw.mp4",
        "in": 130.5,
        "duration_actual": 10
      }
    ],
    "start": 65.174,
    "end": 75.174,
    "duration": 10,
    "text": "最后一辆也解决了。第一关救援完成，接下来进废墟城。",
    "audio": "audio\\shared-zh\\08-result.mp3"
  },
